    "mantik": "<p>LOGIC, sahayı her ardıştırmada yatay veya dikey bir giyotin kesimle daha küçük dikdörtgenlere ayırır. Kesim yeri, iki tarafa düşen bölümlerin alanları toplamı kadar yer ayıracak biçimde belirlenir; bu yüzden tüm bölümler en sonunda tam alanlı dikdörtgen olur. Kesimler bitince ağırlık merkezleri bulunur ve Z = Σ f<sub>ij</sub>·d<sub>ij</sub> hesaplanır.</p>",
    "cozum": "<ol><li><b>Kesim 1 (dikey).</b> Batı: A, B, C, E, H = 12.000 + 8.000 + 6.000 + 8.000 + 2.000 = 36.000 ft². Doğu: D, F, G = 36.000 ft². Saha yüksekliği 200 ft olduğundan her parçanın genişliği 36.000 / 200 = <b>180 ft</b>.</li><li><b>Kesim 2 (yatay)</b>, batı parça (180 × 200): A, B = 20.000 ft² → yükseklik 20.000 / 180 = 111,11; C, E, H = 16.000 ft² → 88,89.</li><li><b>Kesim 3 (yatay)</b>, doğu parça (180 × 200): G = 12.000 → 66,67; D, F = 24.000 → 133,33.</li><li><b>Kesim 4 (yatay)</b>: A = 12.000 / 180 = 66,67; B = 8.000 / 180 = <b>44,44</b>.</li><li><b>Kesim 5 (dikey)</b>, 180 × 88,89 parça: C, H = 8.000 → genişlik 8.000 / 88,89 = 90; E = 8.000 → 90.</li><li><b>Kesim 6 (yatay)</b>, 180 × 133,33 parça: D = 12.000 → 66,67; F → 66,67. <b>Kesim 7 (yatay)</b>, 90 × 88,89 parça: C = 6.000 → 66,67; H = 2.000 → 22,22.</li><li><b>Nihai yerleşim</b> (360 × 200 ft):<div style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 511.99999999999994 288\" width=\"511.99999999999994\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;color:inherit\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LOGIC nihai yerleşim düzeni\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"251.99999999999997\" height=\"93.33333333333333\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"55.33333333333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">A</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"97.33333333333333\" width=\"251.99999999999997\" height=\"62.222222222222214\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.17\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"133.1111111111111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">B</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"159.55555555555554\" width=\"125.99999999999999\" height=\"93.33333333333333\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"67\" y=\"210.88888888888889\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">C</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"252.88888888888886\" width=\"125.99999999999999\" height=\"31.111111111111107\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.55\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"67\" y=\"273.1111111111111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">H</text><rect x=\"130\" y=\"159.55555555555554\" width=\"125.99999999999999\" height=\"124.44444444444443\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"193\" y=\"226.4444444444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">E</text><rect x=\"255.99999999999997\" y=\"4\" width=\"251.99999999999997\" height=\"93.33333333333333\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"55.33333333333333\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">G</text><rect x=\"255.99999999999997\" y=\"97.33333333333333\" width=\"251.99999999999997\" height=\"93.33333333333333\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.31\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"148.66666666666666\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">D</text><rect x=\"255.99999999999997\" y=\"190.66666666666666\" width=\"251.99999999999997\" height=\"93.33333333333333\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">F</text></svg></div></li><li><b>Ağırlık merkezleri</b> (x sağa, y aşağı):<table><thead><tr><th>Bölüm</th><th>Alan</th><th>x</th><th>y</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A</td><td>12.000</td><td>90,00</td><td>33,33</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>8.000</td><td>90,00</td><td>88,89</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>6.000</td><td>45,00</td><td>144,44</td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>12.000</td><td>270,00</td><td>100,00</td></tr><tr><td>E</td><td>8.000</td><td>135,00</td><td>155,56</td></tr><tr><td>F</td><td>12.000</td><td>270,00</td><td>166,67</td></tr><tr><td>G</td><td>12.000</td><td>270,00</td><td>33,33</td></tr><tr><td>H</td><td>2.000</td><td>45,00</td><td>188,89</td></tr></tbody></table></li><li><b>Z hesabı:</b><table><thead><tr><th>Çift (i–j)</th><th>f<sub>ij</sub></th><th>d<sub>ij</sub> (ft)</th><th>f<sub>ij</sub>·d<sub>ij</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A–B</td><td>45</td><td>55,56</td><td>2.500,00</td></tr><tr><td>A–C</td><td>15</td><td>156,11</td><td>2.341,67</td></tr><tr><td>A–D</td><td>25</td><td>246,67</td><td>6.166,67</td></tr><tr><td>A–E</td><td>10</td><td>167,22</td><td>1.672,22</td></tr><tr><td>A–F</td><td>5</td><td>313,33</td><td>1.566,67</td></tr><tr><td>B–D</td><td>30</td><td>191,11</td><td>5.733,33</td></tr><tr><td>B–E</td><td>25</td><td>111,67</td><td>2.791,67</td></tr><tr><td>B–F</td><td>15</td><td>257,78</td><td>3.866,67</td></tr><tr><td>C–E</td><td>5</td><td>101,11</td><td>505,56</td></tr><tr><td>C–F</td><td>10</td><td>247,22</td><td>2.472,22</td></tr><tr><td>D–B</td><td>20</td><td>191,11</td><td>3.822,22</td></tr><tr><td>D–E</td><td>35</td><td>190,56</td><td>6.669,44</td></tr><tr><td>E–F</td><td>65</td><td>146,11</td><td>9.497,22</td></tr><tr><td>E–G</td><td>35</td><td>257,22</td><td>9.002,78</td></tr><tr><td>F–B</td><td>5</td><td>257,78</td><td>1.288,89</td></tr><tr><td>F–E</td><td>25</td><td>146,11</td><td>3.652,78</td></tr><tr><td>F–G</td><td>65</td><td>133,33</td><td>8.666,67</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"3\">Toplam (Z)</th><th>72.216,67</th></tr></tbody></table>Z = <b>72.216,67</b> (slaytta 72.216,67).</li></ol>"
