    "soru": "<p>Örnek-1'deki tesis (8 bölüm, DEN/E matrisi aşağıda) için MIP modeli LINGO ile çözülmüştür. Sahanın boyutları esnetilmiştir: BX = 360,9 ft, BY = 200,9 ft; alanlar A = (12.000; 8.000; 6.000; 12.000; 8.000; 12.000; 12.000; 2.000), en/boy oranı sınırı ratio = 2. Model sınıfı MIQP'dir (Mixed-Integer Quadratic Program) ve çözüm süresi 1 saatle sınırlandırılmıştır. LINGO çözüm raporu: Objective value = 58.772,90; Objective bound = 42.192,55; 112 tam sayılı değişken; Solver Type: B-and-B. Bulunan yerleşimin merkez koordinatları ve yarı boyutları (ft):</p><table><thead><tr><th>i</th><th>Bölüm</th><th>CX(i)</th><th>CY(i)</th><th>LX(i)</th><th>LY(i)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>A</td><td>293,2312</td><td>44,3336</td><td>67,6688</td><td>44,3336</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>B</td><td>180,4500</td><td>44,3336</td><td>45,1125</td><td>44,3336</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>C</td><td>322,3379</td><td>128,9722</td><td>37,2162</td><td>40,3050</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>D</td><td>67,6688</td><td>44,3336</td><td>67,6688</td><td>44,3336</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>E</td><td>142,5608</td><td>144,7836</td><td>35,6402</td><td>56,1164</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>F</td><td>231,6614</td><td>144,7836</td><td>53,4603</td><td>56,1164</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>G</td><td>53,4603</td><td>144,7836</td><td>53,4603</td><td>56,1164</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>H</td><td>316,7445</td><td>185,0886</td><td>31,6228</td><td>15,8114</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th>Bölüm</th><th>Alan (ft²)</th><th>Birim kare</th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>E</th><th>F</th><th>G</th><th>H</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>1. A: Receiving</th><td>12.000</td><td>30</td><td>0</td><td>45</td><td>15</td><td>25</td><td>10</td><td>5</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>2. B: Milling</th><td>8.000</td><td>20</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>30</td><td>25</td><td>15</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>3. C: Press</th><td>6.000</td><td>15</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>5</td><td>10</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>4. D: Screw m/c</th><td>12.000</td><td>30</td><td>0</td><td>20</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>35</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>5. E: Assembly</th><td>8.000</td><td>20</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>65</td><td>35</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>6. F: Plating</th><td>12.000</td><td>30</td><td>0</td><td>5</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>25</td><td>0</td><td>65</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>7. G: Shipping</th><td>12.000</td><td>30</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>8. H: Dummy</th><td>2.000</td><td>5</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Amaç fonksiyonu Σ f<sub>ij</sub>(d<sup>x</sup><sub>ij</sub> + d<sup>y</sup><sub>ij</sub>) biçimindedir. Merkez koordinatlarından amaç değerini kendiniz hesaplayarak raporla karşılaştırınız ve \"local optimality gap\" değerini bulunuz (gap = (Best Obj − Obj Bound) / Obj Bound).</p>",
